==Battleground==
*1 [[Crustaceous Scissorex]] spawns as the boss after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*6 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Capy]] spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*2 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 140 seconds<sup>4,200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The combination of Capy and Scissorex is much less threatening once you realize [[Courier Cat]] does high damage against both enemies. Add the fact that Gory spawns infrequently as a cash source and this stage becomes a simple Scissorex fight.

